# Rust binary crate — gitignore.
#
# `target/` is always ignored: it's the build output directory.
# `Cargo.lock` IS committed for binary crates (this file). For libraries,
# `Cargo.lock` is gitignored — see `code/rust-library/` for that case.

# Build output
/target/

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
